366
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,280
You don't have to pay attention to that
part.

367
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:52,977
If you do most of your work on one computer,

368
00:16:52,977 --> 00:16:55,600
you can just tell it to go through the
